 "arms": {
  "full": {
   "text": "<<A WORD ABOUT MAPPING A SMALL ORCHARD>>\n\nMAP A SMALL ORCHARD FOR A NEIGHBORHOOD NEWSLETTER  \n\nTHE ORCHARD IS LOCATED IN THE CENTER OF THE NEIGHBORHOOD, NEAR THE PARK AND THE SCHOOL. IT CONSISTS OF A VARIETY OF FRUIT TREES, INCLUDING APPLES, BERRIES, AND GRAPEVINES. THE MAP SHOWS THE LOCATION OF EACH TREE, THE SIZE OF THE TREE, AND THE DISTANCE FROM THE MAIN ROAD. THE MAP IS DETAILED AND INCLUDES NOTES ON FARMING PRACTICES AND PLANTING SCHEDULES. THIS MAP WILL HELP NEIGHBORS TO UNDERSTAND THE ORCHARD AND TO PLAN THEIR VISITS OR VISITATIONS. THE MAP IS ALSO AVAILABLE IN PRINT AND DIGITAL FORM.  \n\nTHE MAP WAS CREATED USING A COMPREHENSIVE PLAN THAT INCLUDES THE LOCATION OF ALL TREES, THE SIZE OF EACH TREE, AND THE DISTANCE FROM THE MAIN ROAD. IT ALSO INCLUDES INFORMATION ON THE FARMING PRACTICES USED, SUCH AS COMPOSTING AND WATERING SCHEDULES. THE MAP IS USEFUL FOR BOTH VISITING NEIGHBORS AND FOR PLANNING FUTURE GROWING SEASONAL EVENTS. IT IS IMPORTANT TO NOTE THAT THE ORCHARD IS A COMMUNITY RESOURCE, AND THE MAP IS A TOOL TO HELP NEIGHBORS WORK TOGETHER. THE MAP IS ALSO AVAILABLE IN PRINT AND DIGITAL FORM, SO THAT NEIGHBORS CAN ACCESS IT AT ANY TIME. THE MAP IS A VITAL PART OF THE NEIGHBORHOOD'S COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT INITIATIVE.  \n\n[CONTACT PERSON] CAN BE REACHED AT [PHONENUMBER] FOR ANY QUESTIONS OR TO REQUEST A COPY OF THE MAP. [PAINT COLOR] OF THE ORCHARD'S TREES IS A KEY FEATURE THAT HELPED IN THE MAP'S DESIGN. THE [SHELF LETTER] IS USED TO IDENTIFY THE LOCATION OF THE MAP SHEET IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD LIBRARY. THE [MAP SHEET] IS A PRINTABLE VERSION THAT CAN BE USED BY NEIGHBORS TO VISIT THE ORCHARD IN PERSON.",
